    <projectUrl>https://dotnetreport.com/</projectUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>.Net Ad Hoc Report Builder and Embedded Analytics for MVC that allows programmers to easily add Report building functionality to their ASP .NET Web Application</description>
    <releaseNotes>Added new Features, bug fixes</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>(c) dotnet Report Builder</copyright>
    <tags>embedded analytics, report generator, sql reporting tools, visual studio report designer, ad-hoc reporting, asp .net mvc report, report builder, ad hoc adhoc reports, viewer, reportviewer, sql builder mvc, web forms, query builder,mvc reporting,custom query,query maker, dotnetreport</tags>
